Document::open in debug on this machine, 56dfd93 -> 935b077, at n=256 (zz_v6_time):
- h1-nowrap, one line of 3528 chars: 115 -> 9234 ms (80x);
- h1-nowrap-unspaced, no word spacing: 115 -> 9522 ms (83x);
- h1-wrapped, 12 pages: 326 -> 22922 ms (70x);
- rtl-justified: 345 -> 3178 ms (9.2x);
- plain rtl-prose-justified: 256 -> 501 ms (2.0x);
